## Instructions
1. Address EVERY sub-query. If evidence is insufficient for a sub-query, say so explicitly.
2. Cite every factual claim with [Citation_Label] immediately after the claim.
3. NEVER use a citation label not in the Allowed Citations list above.
4. If you find contradictory information, present both readings with their citations.
5. Write in clear, professional prose. Group by topic/facet.
